eyValue<StringName, Ref<AttributeData>> &pair : attributes_test) {\n        if (_validate_entry(pair.key, pair.value->get_current())) {\n            dict_attributes_test[pair.key] = pair.value;\n        }\n    }    \n    return dict_attributes_test;\n}\n```\nAll I did - used a custom class reference inside TypedDictionary.\nI also tried to declare get_class_static inside of that class, since it says that it's not a member of Ref<AttributeData>, but then it complained that it's duplicate. If you go inside Resource, you will see this:\n```static void register_custom_data_to_otdb() { ClassDB::add_resource_base_extension(\"res\", get_class_static()); }```\nSo it will obviously complain...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780887905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780889882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105058#issuecomment-2780889882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105058","id":2780889882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwQMa","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","