://github.com/Vlado-VG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-06T09:48:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T09:49:31Z","body":"> It compiles perfectly fine on `master` after fixing some typos in the code (you didn't include `register_types.cpp` in the `SCsub`), can you try with latest `master` to compare? Because I can't replicate it with the example you gave, did you test compiling it? Because the zip you sent isn't complete it won't compile (not for that reason, but because the `register_types.cpp` file isn't compiled so the symbols are missing)\n> \n> If you are able to reproduce it on `master` with this project (when fixed) it's likely something compiler specific or something else, but if you can reproduce it on 4.4 with _this_ example, and not on `master` then I'll test it on 4.4 and see if I can work it out, but would appreciate you testing it on `master` first so that I'm not trying to replicate a bug that the example doesn't actually replicate\n\nOkay, so here is my feedback - indeed left me head scratching. So I ran this minimal module that I've sent to you on the newest dev build (pulled from github) and there was no error. I copy-pasted that same code from earlier (**from my own project module**):\n```\nTypedDictionary<StringName, Ref<AttributeData>> AttributeSet::TEST_attributes_to_dictionary() const {\n    TypedDictionary<StringName, Ref<AttributeData>> dict_attributes_test;\n\nfor (const KeyValue<StringName, Ref<AttributeData>> &pair : attributes_test) {\n        if (_validate_entry(pair.key, pair.value->get_current())) {\n            dict_attributes_test[pair.key] = pair.value;\n        }\n    }    \n    return dict_attributes_test;\n}\n```\nI changed nothing else in the code, copiled it and it was successful. Was it a bug in 4.4 and 4.4.1 that was fixed **after** the release, I don't know. I am going to pull and re-compile the source build of 4.4.1 and see if I can reproduce the error. Then I will close this issue, if that's alright...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781336204/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781399575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105058#issuecomment-2781399575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105058","id":2781399575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lyMoX","user":{"login":"Vlado-VG","id":43118270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMTE4Mjcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43118270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG","html_url":"https://github.com/Vlado-VG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vlado-VG/repos","events_url":"https://api